  (text "CLOCKS / I2S\n- X202 24.576 MHz (48 kHz family) and X203 22.5792 MHz (44.1 kHz family), selected by U205 (MCLK_SEL = 0 -> 48k).\n- Mux output fans out through 22R to XMOS, DAC and ADC. XMOS drives BCLK / LRCK / DOUT through 33R."
